WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.919 --> 00:00:05.940
Thanksgiving, if it weren't for the importance
of Christmas, it would be my favorite holiday.

00:00:05.940 --> 00:00:09.890
It's wonderful, and for deep reasons in my
opinion.

00:00:09.890 --> 00:00:14.540
Thanksgiving comes in the autumn and comes
when the harvest is in.

00:00:14.540 --> 00:00:19.000
The thing that you harvest grows of its own
accord.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:21.699
You can't make that happen.

00:00:21.699 --> 00:00:30.039
There was this movement that the nation should
be grateful and atone at the end of each harvest,

00:00:30.039 --> 00:00:31.560
each productive year.

00:00:31.560 --> 00:00:36.850
You have to remember, until the middle of
the 20th century, most everybody was a farmer.

00:00:36.850 --> 00:00:41.429
Those things that I just said were in the
bones of everybody.

00:00:41.429 --> 00:00:43.079
The nation should be grateful.

00:00:43.079 --> 00:00:45.249
Isn't that lovely?

00:00:45.249 --> 00:00:47.050
Freedom is a blessing.

00:00:47.050 --> 00:00:49.160
Learning is a blessing.

00:00:49.160 --> 00:00:52.260
Constitutional government is a blessing.

00:00:52.260 --> 00:00:56.880
We should be apologetic.

00:00:56.880 --> 00:01:02.880
We should be regretful when we fail to count
those blessing and live up to them.

00:01:02.889 --> 00:01:08.130
We should say so to God and we should thank
him for the existence of those blessings and

00:01:08.130 --> 00:01:09.940
our chance to pursue them.

00:01:09.940 --> 00:01:13.580
Not bad for Thanksgiving.

